@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 48
skinparam ranksep 52
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF7DB
skinparam noteBorderColor #D4B45D
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title 删除屏障阻止旧工作复活个人状态
hide footbox
box "客户端" #DBEAFE
participant "Extension" as ext
endbox
box "服务端公开协作" #DCFCE7
participant "Identity and Access" as identity
participant "各 Domain owner" as owner
participant "旧 attempt 或 replay" as worker
participant "Delivery" as delivery
endbox
identity -> identity : S1 授权并建立删除 generation
identity -> owner : S2 通过公开合同清除各自个人数据
owner -> owner : S3 建立屏障并主动清除所拥有数据
worker -> owner : S4 旧 generation 尝试提交
owner --> worker : S5 拒绝旧个人效果
delivery -> owner : S6 重验订阅与当前 generation
owner --> delivery : S7 拒绝旧资格的投递
identity -> ext : S8 通知在线客户端撤销并清除 L1
ext -> ext : S9 离线客户端按 hard expiry 收敛
ext -> identity : S10 重连时鉴权并检查 generation
owner --> identity : S11 报告各自可观察清除完成项
@enduml
